# Least privilege: each identity (certificate CN) can only touch its own topics.

user esp32-living
topic write home/living/telemetry
topic write home/living/status
topic read home/living/cmd

user esp32-bedroom
topic write home/bedroom/telemetry
topic write home/bedroom/status
topic read home/bedroom/cmd

# the hub runs the automation: reads everything in the home, sends commands and notifications
user hub
topic readwrite home/#
topic write notify/#

# the phone app: sees notifications and state, may send manual commands, can't impersonate a sensor
user phone
topic read notify/#
topic read home/+/state
topic write home/+/request

# the Pi's voice keyword spotter (week 3) may only send voice requests
user voice
topic write home/+/request
